<title>USA: Tellabs to supply system in Thailand.</title>
<headline>Tellabs to supply system in Thailand.</headline>
<dateline>LISLE, Ill. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tellabs Inc said Thursday it won a three-year contract to supply its MartisDXX managed access and transport network system to United Information Highway Co Ltd, a new service provider in Thailand.</p>
<p>Initial orders worth US$10 million have been received, Tellabs said. A network of MartisDXX nodes will allow the operator to offer high-speed business communications services.</p>
<p>	  ((Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
